       "type": "text",
       "text": "I haven't entered this order because the dose looks unsafe.\n\nIbuprofen 1600 mg four times daily is 6,400 mg/day. That is twice the usual maximum for adults of 3,200 mg/day. A single 1600 mg dose is also double the usual maximum of 800 mg per dose. Doses this high raise the risk of GI bleeding, kidney injury, and cardiovascular events.\n\nDid you mean one of these?\n- **800 mg by mouth four times daily** (3,200 mg/day), the usual maximum for inflammatory conditions or severe pain.\n- **400 to 600 mg by mouth every 6 hours** (1,600 to 2,400 mg/day), the usual range for pain.\n- **1600 mg total per day**, for example 400 mg four times daily, if the 1600 was meant as a daily total.\n\nTell me the dose and frequency you want and I'll enter it. If you really do intend 1600 mg four times daily, please confirm that. I'd suggest checking it with pharmacy first, and I can add a note to the order."
      }
